WEBVTT

00:04.840 --> 00:06.100
Hey, Mom.

00:07.170 --> 00:08.440
Yes, Rio?

00:08.930 --> 00:11.840
Why do we have black hair?

00:11.840 --> 00:14.840
The people around us don't have it.

00:15.450 --> 00:21.210
Well, your father and mine
came from a far place.

00:23.080 --> 00:24.690
Haruto?

00:27.410 --> 00:28.680
Hey, Rio...

00:30.530 --> 00:31.870
Mom...

00:32.440 --> 00:33.870
Feeling angry now?

00:37.000 --> 00:38.690
Haruto?

00:54.280 --> 00:55.030
Stop!

01:03.610 --> 01:05.090
What was that...

01:22.980 --> 01:25.570
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

02:25.560 --> 02:28.170
Rio...

02:28.680 --> 02:29.660
Rio?

02:31.100 --> 02:33.840
You're looking a bit better now!

02:36.260 --> 02:40.010
CHARGE

02:42.920 --> 02:46.360
I can't believe someone actually caught up.

02:46.360 --> 02:48.520
Although, I was hoping that would happen.

02:50.020 --> 02:53.530
Hey, why the silent treatment?
Why don't you try speaking?

02:54.000 --> 02:55.400
Show me your face.

02:55.770 --> 02:58.530
Huh? Who are you talking to?

03:00.360 --> 03:03.540
You want to save this princess, right?

03:05.630 --> 03:09.010
I think I shouldn't let him think
she's worth being a hostage.

03:09.540 --> 03:11.550
I have business with you, not her.

03:11.550 --> 03:13.080
Me?

03:13.080 --> 03:14.890
I have been looking for you...

03:14.890 --> 03:16.110
Lucius.

03:17.400 --> 03:20.200
Assuming I am Lucius...

03:20.200 --> 03:22.560
What are you gonna do?

03:23.130 --> 03:24.060
I'll kill you.

03:26.710 --> 03:30.060
Now that's something.
How interesting!

03:30.630 --> 03:34.510
So he's the contractor
of the humanoid spirit?

03:34.510 --> 03:36.070
I remember seeing him...

03:36.780 --> 03:40.200
If he's holding a grudge against me,
then we should've met somewhere...

03:40.950 --> 03:42.680
Oh, well.

03:42.680 --> 03:46.080
So? Am I the face you're looking for?

03:47.710 --> 03:50.080
Yeah. I have been searching...

03:50.560 --> 03:53.450
So you're looking to kill me?

03:53.450 --> 03:56.590
But you're looking so collected.

03:56.990 --> 03:58.650
That's not true.

03:58.650 --> 04:01.100
I have been wanting to kill you.

04:01.360 --> 04:05.270
Now, now... You should let out
your true self more, then!

04:05.270 --> 04:08.340
You don't look like
a guy ready to kill someone.

04:08.340 --> 04:10.040
I am letting my emotions out.

04:10.040 --> 04:12.940
I'll kill you, and that's all.

04:13.370 --> 04:15.110
That so?

04:15.670 --> 04:17.240
So who are you?

04:18.110 --> 04:21.330
You finally got to meet the person
you were holding a grudge against,

04:21.330 --> 04:24.120
but you're not gonna introduce yourself?

04:24.410 --> 04:26.580
I told you, I'll kill you.

04:26.580 --> 04:28.120
That's all.

04:28.120 --> 04:31.130
Wow, what a boring guy you are.

04:31.500 --> 04:32.500
However...

04:39.000 --> 04:41.220
Hey, what the hell?!

04:41.220 --> 04:43.890
You can't be wearing that!
It's unfair!

04:44.170 --> 04:45.330
Unfair?

04:45.330 --> 04:46.850
That's rich, coming from you.

04:49.020 --> 04:51.350
So your defence is impenetrable, eh...

04:51.720 --> 04:54.320
Well, it'll be more fun that way.

04:54.730 --> 04:56.730
It's the meeting you've longed for.

04:57.050 --> 04:59.280
Come play with me now!

05:03.380 --> 05:04.190
Take that!

05:06.920 --> 05:08.310
Nice reaction.

05:08.310 --> 05:11.730
But this princess seems to be talking
about something boring.

05:11.730 --> 05:13.830
She must be important to you, right?

05:16.400 --> 05:20.780
Or do you simply not want to involve
a stranger in your revenge?

05:20.780 --> 05:22.230
Either way...

05:22.230 --> 05:24.050
You're so naive!

05:27.850 --> 05:28.520
Aishia!

05:30.430 --> 05:31.390
Behind you!

05:41.700 --> 05:42.930
Aishia!

05:42.930 --> 05:45.200
Looks like the demons
are focusing on you!

05:46.040 --> 05:46.920
Not to worry.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.120
Lady Aishia!

05:51.720 --> 05:52.840
It's not a problem.

05:56.150 --> 05:58.500
What the...
His blade is extending.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.740
Is it some kind of spatial magic?

06:02.430 --> 06:03.320
In that case...

06:18.180 --> 06:21.160
What an annoying brat!

06:28.700 --> 06:33.710
He keeps going at an exquisite
interval as to not hurt the girl...

06:34.150 --> 06:36.210
He's something else...

06:36.210 --> 06:39.430
No way I'd forget someone this strong.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.740
I can't remember...

06:41.740 --> 06:45.140
So that means I met him
really long ago...

06:45.140 --> 06:47.890
When he was still a kid.

06:49.030 --> 06:50.720
All right, I give!

06:53.410 --> 06:57.620
It's no fun if we keep fighting like this.

06:58.350 --> 07:01.730
I don't need fun to kill you.

07:05.030 --> 07:08.450
Let's reveal each other's cards now, shall we?

07:08.450 --> 07:13.200
Unfortunately, I have too many enemies,
I can't be bothered to remember every single one.

07:13.460 --> 07:16.520
But I am interested in you now.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.820
However, you know me,

07:18.820 --> 07:22.300
but I don't know you,
and that's not fun.

07:22.300 --> 07:24.040
That's just not fair.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.220
Not fair?

07:27.200 --> 07:29.220
Who are you?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.390
If you can't recall,

07:31.850 --> 07:35.730
it means that's just
how little you see me.

07:36.270 --> 07:41.230
No way I'd forget about someone
skilled like you if we trade blows.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.160
I'll ask once again.

07:44.540 --> 07:45.800
Who are you?

07:51.110 --> 07:52.600
I refuse to believe...

07:53.010 --> 07:56.750
...you'd kidnap and hurt her
over something trivial like this.

07:56.750 --> 07:59.940
Isn't this the most fun situation?

08:04.840 --> 08:07.260
What a stouthearted brat.

08:07.560 --> 08:10.700
If I don't remember you now...

08:10.700 --> 08:13.760
That means we met
when you were still a little kid.

08:14.870 --> 08:17.390
I take that silence as a yes, all right?

08:18.440 --> 08:20.340
That face...

08:20.340 --> 08:22.770
You're not from around here, are you?

08:25.340 --> 08:26.800
The silent treatment, huh?

08:27.710 --> 08:30.780
In that case, let's make a trade.

08:31.230 --> 08:34.360
I'll just let go of this princess for now.

08:35.370 --> 08:38.160
In exchange, tell me your real identity.

08:38.160 --> 08:40.790
Let's have a fair duel after that.

08:41.420 --> 08:44.520
That's quite a favourable
condition on my side.

08:44.520 --> 08:47.010
I am a benevolent man, after all.

08:47.800 --> 08:49.980
If you're on board,

08:49.980 --> 08:52.800
then I'll let go of the princes first.

08:55.530 --> 08:56.810
Okay.

08:57.190 --> 08:59.270
We have a deal, then.

09:00.050 --> 09:02.910
Stand in the middle where we can see you.

09:03.390 --> 09:06.320
There might still be demons out there.

09:07.080 --> 09:07.830
Got it?

09:09.510 --> 09:10.570
All right, go.

09:12.090 --> 09:12.670
Ha...

09:15.040 --> 09:16.890
Don't come near the princess.

09:19.340 --> 09:21.640
All right, stop there.

09:22.600 --> 09:26.800
If she's in my sight, I can take
her hostage again if I need to.

09:26.800 --> 09:28.210
How this will go...

09:28.530 --> 09:30.720
...depends on his true character.

09:32.580 --> 09:34.630
Please stay back for some more.

09:35.410 --> 09:36.120
Okay.

09:36.570 --> 09:37.790
Well, then.

09:37.790 --> 09:42.230
Now we've evolved from a kidnapper
and the princess' saviour...

09:42.620 --> 09:44.730
...into an avenger and his target for revenge...

09:44.730 --> 09:48.010
...all so gracefully.

09:49.020 --> 09:51.440
Say that you'll keep your word.

09:51.880 --> 09:52.740
Okay?

09:54.890 --> 09:56.690
It was more than a decade ago.

09:57.390 --> 10:00.380
I was living in the capital of Beltrum Kingdom.

10:01.750 --> 10:02.750
Oh...

10:03.080 --> 10:04.490
At that time,

10:04.490 --> 10:07.370
You should have your eyes
set on a certain family.

10:12.780 --> 10:17.480
Oh, I see! So you're from Yagumo!

10:18.260 --> 10:21.380
You have a totally different hair colour now,

10:21.380 --> 10:24.810
so I couldn't remember, eh!

10:27.000 --> 10:29.280
Stop scaring me with that stare.

10:29.950 --> 10:32.480
So you're alive...

10:32.480 --> 10:35.030
No, you survived, eh!

10:35.410 --> 10:37.240
So you're the sniveler back then...

10:37.240 --> 10:40.010
The oh-so-powerless kid!

10:40.890 --> 10:43.630
Seems like you really remember now.

10:43.970 --> 10:47.020
Yeah, I do. I really do.

10:47.020 --> 10:49.470
I've been wanting to see you too.

10:49.470 --> 10:52.160
I've been waiting for this moment exactly,

10:52.160 --> 10:56.300
so I spared you back then.

10:58.130 --> 10:59.750
I'll be back soon.

10:59.750 --> 11:01.970
Don't answer the door
for any strangers, okay?

11:02.680 --> 11:03.780
Okay.

11:06.900 --> 11:09.370
Rio, it's me, Lucius.

11:09.760 --> 11:10.920
Can you open the door?

11:19.750 --> 11:23.410
There are demons with
the face of a human in this world.

11:23.410 --> 11:25.730
You've grown smarter now.

11:27.350 --> 11:28.120
I...

11:29.080 --> 11:30.260
I have decided...

11:31.130 --> 11:32.660
...to survive in this world.

11:33.780 --> 11:35.240
For this moment.

11:36.930 --> 11:40.810
He reeks... Try not to go near him.

11:40.810 --> 11:42.860
It's bad for your body.

11:43.960 --> 11:46.400
I'm sorry for startling you.

11:46.400 --> 11:48.610
What is your name?

11:48.610 --> 11:51.070
Oh, I'm Celia.

11:52.140 --> 11:53.070
Rio.

11:53.350 --> 11:56.070
Rio? That's an unusual name.

11:56.440 --> 11:58.100
I'm an immigrant.

11:58.100 --> 12:01.450
I see. No wonder you have black hair.

12:01.990 --> 12:03.730
There's no time.

12:04.280 --> 12:05.160
Od...

12:05.640 --> 12:07.240
How to use magic...

12:07.670 --> 12:09.160
I'll teach you that...

12:09.540 --> 12:11.000
So learn it by feeling...

12:11.580 --> 12:14.340
How to use magic...

12:15.210 --> 12:17.450
Sharpen your senses.

12:17.910 --> 12:19.880
There is light...

12:19.880 --> 12:21.670
...coming out of your body, right?

12:21.670 --> 12:25.640
Use that light to strengthen
your physical ability,

12:25.640 --> 12:27.110
and also your...

12:27.510 --> 12:28.670
...physical power.

12:29.670 --> 12:31.360
Imagine that...

12:34.740 --> 12:36.970
I'll remove it for you now.
Hang on.

12:38.270 --> 12:40.860
P-Please... Help me!

12:41.360 --> 12:45.990
Would you take me back to the castle?

12:45.990 --> 12:47.250
The castle?

12:48.270 --> 12:50.750
You! Stop!

12:51.620 --> 12:53.960
Lady Christina! Wait!

12:56.180 --> 12:58.340
You lied!

12:59.090 --> 13:01.800
Listen to someone carefully.

13:01.800 --> 13:05.010
Oww! Let go, you filthy!

13:14.600 --> 13:15.500
So...

13:16.110 --> 13:17.920
These are my parents' graves?

13:18.440 --> 13:19.530
That's right.

13:20.040 --> 13:21.900
Can I join my hands?

13:23.080 --> 13:23.760
Go ahead.

13:26.820 --> 13:30.140
I'm finally here, Mom, Dad...

13:30.710 --> 13:33.780
Hey, Rio. Would you tell us...

13:33.780 --> 13:35.740
...about Ayame and Zen?

13:39.930 --> 13:41.640
To put it simply,

13:42.000 --> 13:44.070
they're both already dead.

13:45.880 --> 13:47.960
How did they die?

13:47.960 --> 13:50.980
What kind of life were they living?
That's what we want to know.

13:53.020 --> 13:53.910
My father...

13:54.240 --> 13:56.980
He passed away before
I could remember things.

13:58.250 --> 13:59.610
My mother was so kind,

13:59.920 --> 14:01.720
and she never stopped smiling.

14:03.150 --> 14:06.870
She never showed me that she was
sad of her husband's passing,

14:07.860 --> 14:10.060
and while we didn't live in prosperity,

14:10.420 --> 14:12.160
we still had a fun life.

14:12.900 --> 14:16.130
But she passed away when I was five.

14:16.580 --> 14:18.210
When you were five...

14:18.630 --> 14:21.040
How did Ayame die?

14:22.640 --> 14:24.540
To be honest...

14:24.540 --> 14:27.140
It's a painful story to tell.

14:27.700 --> 14:29.720
Even so, we want to know.

14:30.580 --> 14:32.760
I have survived this long...

14:33.080 --> 14:34.850
...to kill him now.

14:35.150 --> 14:40.060
I'm glad you grew up to be
someone exactly as I imagined.

14:40.060 --> 14:42.610
It's my favourite pastime...

14:42.610 --> 14:45.160
...to ruin someone's life.

14:45.490 --> 14:47.960
Now I'm motivated.

14:47.960 --> 14:49.160
Not bad.

14:49.570 --> 14:53.720
I'm also glad you're still
the same being as I imagined.

14:54.470 --> 14:57.820
Should I reflect and repent for a bit?

14:58.440 --> 15:01.640
I don't want to see you repent,

15:01.640 --> 15:03.150
and I don't want you to.

15:03.910 --> 15:06.180
Man, you're no fun.

15:06.600 --> 15:10.150
Isn't it most fun to take down
someone coming at you...

15:10.150 --> 15:15.390
...with their honest feelings and instincts,
and make them yield?

15:16.190 --> 15:19.990
Oh, yeah.
I heard about this from Zen.

15:19.990 --> 15:24.190
That Ayame used to be
a princess of a certain kingdom.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.190
Huh?

15:25.190 --> 15:29.670
She was a good woman.
She made good provisions.

15:32.540 --> 15:37.390
Even when dying,
she still tried to protect you.

15:37.390 --> 15:40.090
What are you doing, Mister Lucius?!

15:42.460 --> 15:46.490
Please... Don't kill Rio...

15:47.520 --> 15:49.720
I beg you...

15:50.030 --> 15:51.050
That's what she said.

15:51.720 --> 15:54.210
Rio... What?

15:54.930 --> 15:55.730
Rio?

16:00.790 --> 16:03.530
You're looking a bit better now!

16:04.340 --> 16:06.530
That's all your last words?

16:06.820 --> 16:08.760
Yeah, that'll do.

16:08.760 --> 16:12.570
This old man shall play
with you after ten years!

16:13.410 --> 16:14.450
Come at me, boy!

16:14.930 --> 16:16.790
Let's have a duel...

16:18.580 --> 16:19.140
Wha...

16:24.580 --> 16:26.330
Go play by yourself.

16:26.330 --> 16:27.970
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT
CHRONICLES SEASON 2

16:28.940 --> 16:30.140
What...

16:33.780 --> 16:36.750
No way... I couldn't react to that?

16:36.750 --> 16:38.340
Me?

16:38.690 --> 16:41.180
I couldn't see his movements.

16:41.180 --> 16:43.160
What kind of trick is this?

16:44.950 --> 16:46.940
I can see it...
He's slower than before!

16:53.370 --> 16:56.160
What is this outrageous
physical enhancement?!

16:58.880 --> 17:02.400
Damn! His mana just keeps increasing!

17:02.400 --> 17:03.000
Wha...

17:03.610 --> 17:04.290
Ugh!

17:15.320 --> 17:17.480
So I lost sight of him earlier...

17:17.480 --> 17:20.780
...because he moved using
the outrageous physical enhancement?

17:32.090 --> 17:36.830
This brat...
He keeps attacking me so brutally...

17:37.130 --> 17:39.540
But he's not out of breath yet!

17:40.360 --> 17:41.830
Is he a monster?!

17:47.810 --> 17:50.090
Spirit technique?!

18:20.620 --> 18:23.910
What's wrong? Done already?

18:23.910 --> 18:26.630
I'm still pristine here...

18:38.090 --> 18:41.800
My insides are killing me...

18:41.800 --> 18:43.680
Not enough blood...

18:44.130 --> 18:46.810
Gotta reattach my arm...

18:51.390 --> 18:53.470
Since when...

19:01.860 --> 19:04.500
What bad taste.

19:05.070 --> 19:07.000
Not as bad as you.

19:07.390 --> 19:09.310
Let's end this here.

19:10.160 --> 19:12.880
You sure you don't want to arrest me.

19:13.340 --> 19:16.390
Sorry to break it to you,
but I received no such order.

19:38.470 --> 19:40.090
So persistent...

19:40.090 --> 19:44.120
Then I'll erase you
without a trace from this world.

20:04.060 --> 20:05.340
Are you okay?

20:05.340 --> 20:07.600
Y-Yes...

20:07.600 --> 20:09.460
Thank you.

20:10.390 --> 20:15.320
So you do have to protect the princess...

20:16.540 --> 20:18.090
I'll end it with this.

20:26.810 --> 20:30.250
You're too late...

20:30.250 --> 20:32.620
What a massive failure.

20:32.620 --> 20:36.760
You shouldn't have been too playful.

20:37.490 --> 20:39.680
I have business with that man.

20:40.140 --> 20:44.420
Unfortunately, so do I.

20:44.420 --> 20:46.170
First come, first served.

20:46.170 --> 20:47.640
No, no, no...

20:48.080 --> 20:51.250
You're trying to kill him, right?

20:51.250 --> 20:55.150
That means I can't settle my business
with him if you are, then.

20:55.660 --> 20:58.970
Then what will you do?
Run away?

20:58.970 --> 21:02.160
Are you trying to hightail it
like a coward too, Lucius?

21:02.500 --> 21:03.960
What?

21:03.960 --> 21:09.060
Are you planning to have me cut
your right arm ten years later?

21:09.060 --> 21:10.350
You...

21:10.350 --> 21:12.170
Reiss, let me go!

21:12.470 --> 21:13.320
Reiss?

21:13.320 --> 21:14.670
Not happening.

21:15.100 --> 21:19.100
The moment this physical
enhancement wears off, you'll die.

21:19.100 --> 21:21.990
Cut the crap! I still can...

21:21.990 --> 21:24.920
We just have to retreat for now.

21:25.970 --> 21:27.770
You think I'll let you?!

21:27.770 --> 21:32.770
I am confident in running away
and hiding my presence.

21:32.770 --> 21:36.110
But what if I'm faced against you?

21:36.110 --> 21:38.650
It's worth trying.

21:46.190 --> 21:47.540
Here we go.

21:47.900 --> 21:50.140
Haruto, watch the sky!

22:03.470 --> 22:04.500
Rio...

23:40.020 --> 23:40.910
TO THE DESTINED TOMORROW

23:40.910 --> 23:42.460
TO THE DESTINED TOMORROW
To the Destined Tomorrow.

23:42.460 --> 23:45.030
TO THE DESTINED TOMORROW

23:45.030 --> 23:47.840
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

23:47.840 --> 23:50.990
ILLUSTRATION BY: FUTAGO MINAZUKI
